# Optional root-owned /etc/assura/deployment.env for assura-deploy.service.
# Omit these variables for a fresh Assura installation. When replacing only the
# deploy helper on the existing VM, its legacy layout is detected automatically.
# These settings configure deployment, not the application's runtime.env.
# Keep an existing application service installed until a coordinated migration;
# installing assura.service does not migrate its Linux account or persistent data.
# ASSURA_DEPLOY_ROOT=/opt/legalmate
# ASSURA_DATA_ROOT=/var/lib/legalmate
# ASSURA_SERVICE_USER=legalmate
# ASSURA_SERVICE_GROUP=legalmate
# ASSURA_SERVICE=legalmate.service
# ASSURA_DEPLOY_SERVICE=assura-deploy.service
# ASSURA_DEPLOY_LOCK=/run/lock/legalmate-deploy.lock
# ASSURA_REPOSITORY_URL=git@github.com:Chien-Wu/assura.git
